{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-gen-49-1","title":"Genesis 49:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":49,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":49,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Jacob calls his sons to bless them. 3 Their blessing in particular. 29 He charges them about his burial. 33 He dies.</p>\n<p>Gather. De 31:12,28,29; 33:1-29; Ps 25:14; 105:15; Isa 22:14; 53:1; Da 2:47 Da 10:1; Am 3:7; Lu 2:26; Ro 1:17,18; Heb 10:24,25; 13:1; Re 4:1 last days. Nu 24:14; De 4:30; 31:29; Isa 2:2; 39:6; Jer 23:20; Da 2:28,29 Da 10:14; Mic 4:1; Ac 2:17; 1Ti 4:1; 2Ti 3:1; Heb 1:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-49-2","title":"Genesis 49:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":49,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":49,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>hearken. Ps 34:11; Pr 1:8,9; 4:1-4; 5:1; 6:20; 7:1,24; 8:32; 23:22,26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-49-3","title":"Genesis 49:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":49,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":49,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>my firstborn. 29:32; 46:8; 48:18; Nu 1:20; 26:5; 1Ch 2:1; 5:1,3 my might. De 21:17; Ps 78:51; 105:36</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-49-4","title":"Genesis 49:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":49,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":49,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>Unstable. Jas 1:6-8; 2Pe 2:14; 3:16 thou shalt not excel. Heb. do not thou excel. 46:8; Nu 32:1-42; De 33:6 because. 35:22; De 5:21; 27:20; 1Ch 5:1; 1Co 5:1 he went up to my couch. or, my couch is gone.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-49-5","title":"Genesis 49:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":49,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":49,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Simeon. 29:33,34; 34:25-31; 46:10,11; Pr 18:9 instruments, etc. or, their swords are weapons of violence. 34:25-29,31</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-49-6","title":"Genesis 49:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":49,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":49,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>O my soul. Jud 5:21; Ps 42:5,11; 43:5; 103:1; Jer 4:19; Lu 12:19 come. 34:30; Ps 5:10; 26:4,5; 28:3; 94:20,21; 139:19; Pr 1:11,15,16; 12:5 secret. De 27:24; Ps 26:9; 64:2; Jer 15:17 unto their. Ps 1:1; 26:9; 94:20; 2Co 6:14 honour. Ps 16:9; 30:12; 57:8 a man. 34:25,26,30 digged down a wall. or, houghed oxen.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-49-7","title":"Genesis 49:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":49,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":49,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>Cursed. 2Sa 13:15,22-28; Pr 26:24,25; 27:3 I will divide. Jos 19:1-9; 21:1-45; 1Ch 4:24-31,39,40; 6:65</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-49-8","title":"Genesis 49:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":49,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":49,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>shall praise. 29:35; 44:18-34; 46:12; De 33:7; 1Ch 5:2; Ps 76:1; Heb 7:14 thy hand. Nu 1:27; 10:14; 26:22; Jud 1:1,2; 20:18; 2Sa 24:9; 1Ki 4:1-34 1Ch 12:1-40; 2Ch 11:12-17; 14:8; 15:9; 17:2,14-16; 30:11 Ps 18:40-43; 78:68-71; Isa 9:7; Phm 2:10,11; Heb 7:14; 10:13 Re 5:5; 11:15 the neck. Jos 10:24; 2Sa 22:41; Eze 21:29 thy father's. 27:29; 37:7-10; 42:6; 2Sa 5:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-49-9","title":"Genesis 49:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":49,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":49,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>a lion's. Ho 5:4,14; 1Co 15:24; Re 5:5 he stooped. Nu 23:24; 24:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-49-10","title":"Genesis 49:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":49,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":49,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>sceptre. Nu 24:17; Ps 60:7; Jer 30:21; Ho 11:12; Eze 19:11,14; Zec 10:11 lawgiver. Nu 21:18; Ps 60:7; 108:8; Isa 33:22 between. De 28:57 until. Isa 9:6; 11:1-5; 62:11; Jer 23:5,6; Eze 21:27; Da 9:25; Mt 1:21 Mt 17:5; 21:9; Lu 1:32,33; Joh 9:7; 18:31; 19:12,15 the gathering. Ps 72:8-11; Isa 2:2; 11:10,12,13; 42:1,3,4; 49:6,7,22,23; 55:4,5 Isa 60:1,3-5; Eze 21:27; Hag 2:7; Zec 2:11; 8:20-23; Mt 25:32 Lu 1:32,33; 2:30-32; Joh 12:32; Ro 15:12; 2Co 5:10; Heb 7:14 Re 11:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-49-11","title":"Genesis 49:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":49,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":49,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>his foal. Isa 63:1-3 he washed. 1Ki 4:20,25; 2Ki 18:32; Joe 3:18; Mic 4:4; Re 7:14; 19:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-49-12","title":"Genesis 49:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":49,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":49,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>Pr 23:29</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-49-13","title":"Genesis 49:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":49,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":49,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>30:20; De 33:18,19; Jos 19:10-16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-49-14","title":"Genesis 49:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":49,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":49,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>30:18; De 33:18; Jos 19:17-23; Jud 5:15; 10:1; 1Ch 12:32</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-49-15","title":"Genesis 49:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":49,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":49,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>rest. Jos 14:15; Jud 3:11; 2Sa 7:1 bowed. Ps 81:6; Eze 29:18; Mt 23:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-49-16","title":"Genesis 49:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":49,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":49,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>30:6; Nu 10:25; De 33:22; Jud 13:2,24,25; 15:20; 18:1,2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-49-17","title":"Genesis 49:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":49,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":49,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>shall be. Jud 14:1-15:20; 16:22-30; 18:22-31; 1Ch 12:35 an adder. Heb. an arrow-snake.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-49-18","title":"Genesis 49:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":49,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":49,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>Ps 14:7; 25:6; 40:1; 62:1,5; 85:7; 119:41,166,174; 123:2; 130:5 Isa 8:17; 25:9; 36:8; 30:18; 33:2; La 3:25; Mic 7:7; Mt 1:21 Mr 15:43; Lu 1:30; 2:25,30; 23:51; Ro 8:19,25; Ga 5:5; 1Th 1:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-49-19","title":"Genesis 49:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":49,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":49,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>30:11; 46:16; Nu 32:1-42; De 33:20,21; Jos 13:8; Jud 10:1-11:40 1Ch 3:18-22; 5:11-22,26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-49-20","title":"Genesis 49:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":49,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":49,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>30:13; 46:17; De 33:24,25; Jos 19:24-31</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-49-21","title":"Genesis 49:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":49,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":49,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>30:8; 46:24; De 33:23; Jos 19:32-39; Jud 4:6,10; 5:18; Ps 18:33,34 Mt 4:15,16 Nepthalim.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-49-22","title":"Genesis 49:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":49,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":49,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>a fruitful. 30:22-24; 41:52; 46:27; 48:1,5,16,19,20; Nu 32:1-42; De 33:17 Jos 16:1-10; 17:14-17; Ps 1:1-3; 128:1,3; Eze 19:11 branches. Heb. daughters.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-49-23","title":"Genesis 49:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":49,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":49,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>37:4,18,24,28; 39:7-20; 42:21; Ps 64:3; 118:13; Joh 16:33; Ac 14:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-49-24","title":"Genesis 49:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":49,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":49,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>his bow. Ne 6:9; Ps 27:14; 28:8; 89:1; Col 1:11; 2Ti 4:17 were made. Job 29:20; Ps 18:32-35; 37:14,15; 44:7; Zec 10:12; Ro 14:4 the mighty. 35:10,11; Ex 3:6; Ps 18:1,30,32,34; 132:2,5; Isa 29:24; 60:16 the shepherd. 45:5,7,11; 47:12; 50:21; Nu 27:16-18; De 34:9; Jos 1:1-9; 24:1-33 Ps 80:1 the stone. De 32:4; Ps 118:22; Isa 28:16; Zec 3:9; Mt 21:42; Mr 12:10 Lu 20:17; Ac 4:11; Eph 2:20; 1Pe 2:4-8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-49-25","title":"Genesis 49:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":49,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":49,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>the God. 28:13,21; 35:3; 43:23; De 8:17; 28:12; 33:1,13-17 the Almighty. 17:1; 35:11 with blessings. De 28:2-12; 33:13; Ps 84:11; 85:12; Mt 6:33; 1Co 3:21,22; Eph 1:3 Php 4:19; 1Ti 4:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-49-26","title":"Genesis 49:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":49,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":49,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>have prevailed. 27:27-29,39,40; 28:3,4; Eph 1:3 everlasting hills. De 33:15; Ps 89:36; Isa 54:10; Eze 37:25,26; Jon 2:6; Hab 3:6 they shall. De 33:16; Ps 132:18 was separate. 37:28; Nu 6:2; Ps 105:17-22; Isa 66:5; Ac 7:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-49-27","title":"Genesis 49:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":49,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":49,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>ravin. 35:18; 46:21; De 33:12 a wolf. Nu 23:24; Jud 3:15-29; 20:21,25; 1Sa 11:4-11; 14:1-15:35; 17:1-58 Ac 8:3; 9:1; Php 3:5 at night. Jer 5:6; Eze 22:25,27; Ho 13:7,8; Zep 3:3; Mt 7:15; 10:16; Ac 20:29</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-49-28","title":"Genesis 49:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":49,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":49,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>the twelve. Nu 23:24; Es 8:7,9,11; 9:1-10:3; Eze 39:8-10; Zec 14:1-7 every one. 35:22; Ex 28:21; 1Ki 18:31; Ac 26:7; Jas 1:1; Re 7:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-49-29","title":"Genesis 49:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":49,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":49,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>gathered. Ro 12:6-21 bury me. 15:15; 25:8-17; 35:29; Heb 12:23 in the cave. 47:30; 2Sa 19:37 Ephron. 50:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-49-30","title":"Genesis 49:30","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":49,"verseStart":30,"chapterEnd":49,"verseEnd":30},"content":"<p>Abraham bought. 23:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-49-31","title":"Genesis 49:31","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":49,"verseStart":31,"chapterEnd":49,"verseEnd":31},"content":"<p>23:3,16-20; 25:9; 35:29; 47:30; 50:13; Ac 7:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-49-32","title":"Genesis 49:32","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":49,"verseStart":32,"chapterEnd":49,"verseEnd":32},"content":"<p>23:17-20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-gen-49-33","title":"Genesis 49:33","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"GEN","chapterStart":49,"verseStart":33,"chapterEnd":49,"verseEnd":33},"content":"<p>had made. 1,24-26; Jos 24:27-29; Heb 11:22 and yielded. 29; 15:5; 25:8,17; 35:29; Job 5:26; 14:10; 30:23; Ec 12:7; Isa 57:1,2 Lu 2:29; Heb 11:13-16; 12:23</p>"}]}